# Claude Code Rules for Murhakaverit Website

## 📚 Required Reading

Before starting any coding task, **ALWAYS** read these files first:

1. **[docs/style-guide.md](docs/style-guide.md)** - Tailwind CSS v4 styling best practices (CRITICAL)
2. **[documentation/ARCHITECTURE.md](documentation/ARCHITECTURE.md)** - Project structure and architecture
3. **[documentation/AGENTS.md](documentation/AGENTS.md)** - AI agent development guidelines

## 🎨 Styling Rules (CRITICAL)

### Always Use Theme Colors

```tsx
// ✅ CORRECT - Use Tailwind utilities from @theme
<div className="bg-almost-black text-blood-red">

// ❌ WRONG - No hardcoded colors
<div className="bg-[#0a0000]" style={{ color: '#8b0000' }}>
```

### Available Theme Colors
- **Horror theme:** `bg-blood-red`, `bg-blood-red-dark`, `bg-almost-black`, `bg-pure-black`
- **Gamma theme:** `bg-gamma-surface`, `bg-gamma-ambient`, `text-gamma-contrast`
- **Keywords:** `text-keyword-character`, `text-keyword-item`, `text-keyword-evidence`

### Texture Classes
- `.texture-subtle-stripes` - Black with subtle red stripes
- `.texture-blood-cells` - Organic blood cell pattern
- `.texture-cross-hatch` - Crime scene evidence pattern
- `.texture-noise` - Film grain overlay

## 🏗️ Architecture Rules

### File Organization
```
src/
├── app/              # Next.js App Router (Server Components)
│   ├── nkl-2068/    # NKL project-specific pages
│   └── themes/      # Theme CSS files
├── components/       # React components
│   ├── common/      # Shared UI components
│   └── hero/        # Landing page components
└── lib/             # Utilities and data loaders
```

### Component Guidelines
1. **Server Components by default** - Only add `'use client'` when needed
2. **Props over state** - Minimize client-side state
3. **Composition over configuration** - Prefer composable components
4. **TypeScript strict mode** - All new code must be typed

## 🚀 Development Workflow

### Before Coding
1. Read relevant documentation (style-guide.md, ARCHITECTURE.md)
2. Check if similar patterns exist in codebase
3. Use existing theme colors and utilities
4. Follow established naming conventions

### Testing Requirements
```bash
# Run before committing
bun run lint        # ESLint checks
bun run build       # Production build
bun run test        # Playwright e2e tests
```

### Commands (via Nix)
```bash
nix develop                              # Enter dev environment
nix develop --command bun run dev        # Start dev server
nix develop --command bun run build      # Build for production
nix run .#test                           # Run Playwright tests
```

## 📝 Code Style

### Naming Conventions
- **Components:** PascalCase (`FuturisticCard.tsx`)
- **Utilities:** camelCase (`getNoteBySlug`)
- **CSS classes:** kebab-case (`.crime-scene-border`)
- **CSS variables:** kebab-case (`--color-blood-red`)

### Import Order
1. React imports
2. Next.js imports
3. Third-party libraries
4. Local components
5. Local utilities
6. Types
7. Styles

### CSS Guidelines
```css
/* ✅ CORRECT - Use @theme for new colors */
@theme {
  --color-new-shade: #1a0505;
}

/* ✅ CORRECT - Add legacy variable */
@layer base {
  :root {
    --new-shade: var(--color-new-shade);
  }
}

/* ✅ CORRECT - Component classes in @layer */
@layer components {
  .my-component {
    background: var(--color-new-shade);
  }
}
```

## 🎯 Project-Specific Rules

### Horror/Crime Theme
- All landing page components use horror theme colors
- Crime scene tape uses blood-red background
- Hero uses houndstooth pattern with almost-black background
- NKL pages use Gamma theme (futuristic blue/cyan)

### Responsive Design
- Mobile-first approach
- Use Tailwind breakpoints: `sm:`, `md:`, `lg:`
- Test on mobile and desktop viewports

### Performance
- Minimize client components (use Server Components)
- Avoid unnecessary re-renders
- Use React.cache() for expensive operations
- Keep bundle size under 150KB first load

## 🚫 Forbidden Patterns

### Never Do This
```tsx
// ❌ Hardcoded colors
style={{ backgroundColor: '#ff0000' }}

// ❌ Inline styles for simple colors
style={{ color: 'red' }}

// ❌ Creating CSS files without @layer
.my-class { /* No layer wrapper */ }

// ❌ Importing CSS variables incorrectly
var(--blood-red)  // ❌ Use var(--color-blood-red) instead
```

### Always Do This
```tsx
// ✅ Tailwind utilities
className="bg-blood-red text-white"

// ✅ CSS variables from theme
background: var(--color-blood-red)

// ✅ Layer organization
@layer components { .my-class { } }

// ✅ Theme color references
var(--color-blood-red)
```

